    "original": "而把 $5x$ 看成第一项与第二项的和的两倍（$5x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}$）",
    "reason": "The printed sum claim would require the identity 5x=2(x+5/2), which fails at x=0 (0 versus 5). The displayed identity 5x=2*x*(5/2) is twice the product, consistent with p0255#8 and the difference-square expansion in p0256#6. Correct only 和 to 积; retain 5/2, the subtraction sign and every displayed formula."
